Cris Taxi Bucharest has a fleet of 1000 cars (Skoda Octavia, Renault Clio, Dacia Logan).
Among the services offered by CrisTaxi Bucharest you will find a modern taxi dispatcher, based on online and telephone orders

OsmAnd is an offline world map application based on OpenStreetMap (OSM), which allows you to navigate taking into account the preferred roads and vehicle dimensions. Plan routes based on inclines and record GPX tracks without an internet connection.
OsmAnd is an open source app. We do not collect user data and you decide what data the app will have access to.

Main features:

Map view
• Choice of places to be displayed on the map: attractions, food, health and more;
• Search for places by address, name, coordinates, or category;
• Map styles for the convenience of different activities: touring view, nautical map, winter and ski, topographic, desert, off-road, and others;
• Shading relief and plug-in contour lines;
• Ability to overlay different sources of maps on top of each other;

GPS Navigation
• Plotting a route to a place without an Internet connection;
• Customizable navigation profiles for different vehicles: cars, motorcycles, bicycles, 4x4, pedestrians, boats, public transport, and more;
• Change the constructed route, taking into account the exclusion of certain roads or road surfaces;
• Customizable information widgets about the route: distance, speed, remaining travel time, distance to turn, and more;

Route Planning and Recording
• Plotting a route point by point using one or multiple navigation profiles;
• Route recording using GPX tracks;
• Manage GPX tracks: displaying your own or imported GPX tracks on the map, navigating through them;
• Visual data about the route - descents/ascents, distances;
• Ability to share GPX track in OpenStreetMap;

Creation of points with different functionality
• Favourites;
• Markers;

OpenStreetMap
• Making edits to OSM;
• Updating maps with a frequency of up to one hour;

Additional features
• Compass and radius ruler;
• Mapillary interface;
• Night theme;
• Large community of users around the world, documentation, and support;


Paid features:


OsmAnd Maps+ (in-app or subscription):
• Unlimited map downloads;
• Topo data (Contour lines and Terrain);
• Nautical depths;
• Offline Wikipedia;
• Apple CarPlay support;

OsmAnd Pro (subscription):
• All Maps+ features;
• Weather forecast on the map online/offline;
• OsmAnd Cloud (backup and restore);
• Customize Route line;
• Hourly map updates.

TFI Live: Real Time updates and Journey Planning in one app

Description:
The TFI Live App, brought to you by the National Transport Authority (NTA) aims to make accessing Real Time service information and Journey Planning across the Transport for Ireland network as seamless as possible. 
Key features of the App include:                             
•Ability to view Real Time departure information for Bus Éireann, Dublin Bus, Go Ahead Ireland, Luas, Iarnród Éireann Irish Rail, TFI Local Link and other TFI services;
•Option to select your origin and destination to find the best route for your journey;
•Search tool for route specific timetables and maps;
•Function to save your favourite journeys, departures and timetables for quick access on the go.

We hope you enjoy using the TFI Live App. 
For more information on the Transport for Ireland (TFI) network, visit www.transportforireland.ie

# # #


Updates coming soon:


• New arrangements to be displayed on the app in instances where services are unexpectedly disrupted;
• Unforeseen amendments to the routes to be displayed when searching using the ‘leave now’ feature;
•Departures originating from different stops to be displayed in chronological order within the timetable. Currently it is advised to use the ‘earlier’ and ‘later’ buttons when searching bus departures for the most accurate information;
• Ability to view all intermediate stops when searching rail timetables. Currently the appropriate information will appear in your journey plan suggestions;
• Accurate information on Luas trip duration to be displayed when using the ‘leave now’ function. It is currently suggested you use the ‘leave after’ or ‘arrive by’ options for best search results;


The NTA is a statutory body which oversees the delivery and regulation of public transports services in Ireland.

The new TaxiClub application will help you book a taxi all over Moldova. A user-friendly application interface will help you easily place an order. It is designed for users of all ages to help them get the right information in any kind of situations. Get rid of the waste of time for explanations, where to meet you and where the destination point is. Just use one of the currently available options:
- address selection from the built-in catalog;
- search for the address on the Google Maps or/and Yandex Maps;
- book a car by pointing on the map.
Get permanent updates regarding  your order on the smartphone screen:
- distance from the start address to the destination point;
- the preliminary cost of the order;
- current status of the order;
- data on the assigned car;
- final check of the trip.
If necessary, use the option to communicate with the driver directly from the application.
Your choice is important for us, so we strive to improve your comfort when using our taxi services. Try the mobile application to call a taxi and make sure each of our interactions will become even more convenient and pleasant.

Opti is a taxi booking app.

Opti will allow you to find a car quickly, as we are looking for a driver close to you.

Our taxi service is available in 32 cities of Ukraine, Poland and Lithuania.

Opti has the following advantages in the taxi market:
you can order a taxi just in a few clicks;
pay with cash or card;
bonus system – you can get a free ride;
referral system – bring your friends and receive bonuses;
choose additional services: air conditioning, pet transportation, and other;
blacklist taxi drivers for inappropriate behavior;
rate the driver and leave a comment after the trip, we appreciate your opinion.

Opti operates in Poland, Lithuania and Ukraine, namely in Kyiv, Lviv, Dnipro, Odesa, Zaporizhzhya, Chernivtsi, Rivne, Ivano-Frankivsk, Kryvyi Rih, Zhytomyr, Kharkiv, Vinnytsia, Lutsk, Kamianske, Mykolaiv, Kherson, Khmelnytskyi, Ternopil, Sumy, Warsaw (Poland), Gdansk (Poland), Gdynia (Poland), Sopot (Poland), Wroclaw (Poland), Poznan (Poland), Vilnius (Lithuania), Jonava (Lithuania) and Kaunas (Lithuania).

If you have any suggestions or find a bug, please contact us: ios@optima.fm

Compatibility: iOS 13.5.1 or later.
The app can run on iPhone 6S, iPhone 7, iPhone 8, iPhone X, iPhone XS, iPhone XS Max, iPhone 11, iPhone 11 Pro, iPhone 11 Pro Max, iPhone SE.
Languages: Russian, Ukrainian, English, Polish.
